PASS: one-tap start into an empty canvas, two tabs over one drawing, free effects that reach the canvas, PRO parts built free and gated only at save, a movement kept on a shelf and taken back down without touching the cut, a piece kept as its own picture and brought back, movement order changed by dragging, a batch preview that builds one cut for real without writing anything, empty canvas never counts as finished, 완성 declaration separate from autosave, autosave on backgrounding, one save per double tap, copy-previous as an independent document, captions saved with the drawing, temporary and adopted set references, re-edit returns a cut to 작업 중, board states, the last open cut returning to the board, export flow that only claims what it measured, share retry, legacy stores preserved and readable, guarded set deletion, save failure that never claims a completion, an unreadable store that names the cause and writes nothing. Native modules/WebView mocked; drawing and file delivery still require a device.
PASS: project image ownership, orphan set difference across projects, shared-path protection, deletion guard for store snapshots and foreign files. File system mocked.
PASS: one-finger stroke, two-finger tap undo, three-finger tap redo across staggered lifts, drag is not a tap, three consecutive undo+redo steps restore every state in order, new stroke clears redo, reference move/pinch. DOM shimmed; Android touch delivery still requires device test.
PASS: flood fill stays inside closed line art, respects undo/redo, touches only the active drawing, never reaches references, and yields to multi-touch gestures; captions are painted into the export but never into a layer, survive undo, and travel with a copied cut. Canvas rasteriser is a test double; device test still required.
PASS: zip structure parses, crc32 agrees with zlib, slot ordering, 부가 이미지와 공식 도구용 프레임 폴더·안내 쪽지, 제출 형식(WebP)이 묶음에 들어가고 못 만든 컷은 GIF 로 남는 것, reference/canon/working layers excluded, safe file naming, empty set refused. File system mocked.
PASS: a flawless final passes, real defects still fail, 공식 가이드에서 읽은 용량·개수·형식이 실제로 강제되고, artwork judgement is never scored, identical exports are reported, messages are Korean, and QA and export judge the same asset. File system mocked.
